From 842e4f154799378e34beea64a4f6dfe6c37e1493 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:50:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] feat(issues): add add_issue_labels and
 remove_issue_labels

Changing one label with issue_write means reading the labels and
writing back the whole set, which loses concurrent changes. The new
tools use the REST add and remove endpoints, so other labels are left
alone, and return the labels after the change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
